  "display_name": "TikTok — TopView / Reservation ad",
  "description": "Reserved TopView placement. The tightest TikTok envelope: a short fixed duration window and a much higher minimum bitrate than In-Feed Auction.",
  "origin": "shipped",
  "ruleset_version": "2026-08-09.1",
  "last_verified_date": "2026-08-09",
  "byte_convention": "Decimal bytes (1 MB = 1,000,000).",
  "caveats": [
    "TopView requires roughly five times the minimum bitrate of In-Feed Auction (2,500 kbps versus 516 kbps). Do not reuse an In-Feed master here without checking.",
    "Spark Ads (Pull) on this placement carry no duration restriction because they inherit the organic post.",
    "TikTok's ad help pages specify containers but do not authoritatively enumerate codecs."
  ],
